#. Tag: title
#: makemostof.docbook:27
#, no-c-format
msgid "Basic Accounting"
msgstr "Osnovno računovodstvo"

#. Tag: para
#: makemostof.docbook:29
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Imagine your money as balls, or beans, and to stop them rolling around you "
"keep them in a box, or pot. Accounting, or Bookkeeping, is the process of "
"counting and keeping track of the beans in the pot, or several pots."
msgstr ""
"Zamislite svoj novac kao lopte, ili zrna graha, da se ne bi konstantno "
"kotrljale, držite ih u kutiji, ili u loncu. Računovdstvo, ili Knjigovodstvo "
"je proces brojanja i praćenja zrna graha u loncu, ili više lonaca."

#. Tag: para
#: makemostof.docbook:35
#, fuzzy, no-c-format
#| msgid ""
#| "You have some money in the pot marked <quote>Cash</quote>. You buy some "
#| "goods, so you take some beans out of the cash pot and place them into "
#| "another pot marked <quote>Supplier.</quote> The supplier gives you some "
#| "goods in exchange for the cash, so you take the beans out of the pot "
#| "marked <quote>Supplier</quote> and put them in the pot marked "
#| "<quote>Goods</quote>."
msgid ""
"You have some money in the pot marked <quote>Cash</quote>. You buy some "
"goods, so you take some beans out of the cash pot and place them into "
"another pot marked <quote>Supplier</quote>. The supplier gives you some "
"goods in exchange for the cash, so you take the beans out of the pot marked "
"<quote>Supplier</quote> and put them in the pot marked <quote>Goods</quote>."
msgstr ""
"Imate nešto novca u loncu označenom <quote>Gotovina</quote>. Kupite neke "
"stvari, tako da uzmete nekoliko zrna graha iz lonca sa gotovinom i stavite "
"ih u drugi lonac označen sa <quote>Dobavljač.</quote> Dobavljač vam daje "
"neku robu u zamjenu za gotovinu, tako da uzimate zrna graha iz lonca "
"označenog sa <quote>Dobavljač</quote> i stavljate ih u lonac označen sa "
"<quote>Roba</quote>."

#. Tag: para
#: makemostof.docbook:43
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The goods have a value (the price you paid) so you still have the same "
"amount of beans, some representing cash and some representing goods."
msgstr ""
"Roba ima vrijednost (cijena koju ste platili) tako da i dalje imate istu "
"količinu zrna graha, neka predstavljaju gotovinu, a neka predstavljaju robu."

#. Tag: para
#: makemostof.docbook:48
#, fuzzy, no-c-format
#| msgid ""
#| "In this case you have two movements of beans, or transactions. Each "
#| "transaction needs two entries, one to take beans out and one to put beans "
#| "in. This is called <quote>double entry bookkeeping</quote> or "
#| "<quote>double entry accounting.</quote> The recording of the transactions "
#| "is done in a <quote>Ledger;</quote> each pot is known as an "
#| "<quote>Account</quote> or <quote>Ledger code</quote>."
msgid ""
"In this case you have two movements of beans, or transactions. Each "
"transaction needs two entries, one to take beans out and one to put beans "
"in. This is called <quote>double entry bookkeeping</quote> or <quote>double "
"entry accounting</quote>. The recording of the transactions is done in a "
"<quote>Ledger</quote>; each pot is known as an <quote>Account</quote> or "
"<quote>Ledger code</quote>."
msgstr ""
"U tom slučaju imate dva pomjeranja zrna, ili transakcije. Svaka transakcija "
"treba imati dva ulaza, jedan iz kojeg se vade zrna i drugi u koji se "
"stavljaju zrna. Ovo se naziva <quote>knjigovodstvo dva ulaza</quote> ili "
"<quote>računovodstvo dva ulaza.</quote> Bilježenje transakcija se radi u "
"<quote>Finansijska knjiga;</quote>, svaki lonac je identifikovan kao "
"<quote>Račun</quote> ili  <quote>Kod finansijske knjige</quote>."

#. Tag: para
#: makemostof.docbook:57
#, fuzzy, no-c-format
#| msgid ""
#| "Now you take some goods and give them to a customer, who gives you some "
#| "cash in exchange. The goods were worth some beans and, hopefully, the "
#| "customer has given us more beans than that, so making a profit. To over "
#| "simplify, the beans from the Goods pot come back as Cash, but we can "
#| "split that as the <quote>Cost of Goods sold</quote> and <quote>Profit.</"
#| "quote> This transaction has three entries; one side of the <quote>double "
#| "entry</quote> has been split."
msgid ""
"Now you take some goods and give them to a customer, who gives you some cash "
"in exchange. The goods were worth some beans and, hopefully, the customer "
"has given us more beans than that, so making a profit. To over simplify, the "
"beans from the Goods pot come back as Cash, but we can split that as the "
"<quote>Cost of Goods sold</quote> and <quote>Profit</quote>. This "
"transaction has three entries; one side of the <quote>double entry</quote> "
"has been split."
msgstr ""
"Sada uzimate neku robu i dajete je mušteriji, koja vam zauzvrat daje "
"gotovinu. Roba je imala neku vrijednost u zrnima, i za nadati se je da nam "
"je mušterija dala više zrna tako da pravimo profit. Za dodatno "
"pojednostavljenje, zrna iz lonca za robu se vraćaju kao gotovina, ali to "
"možemo podijeliti na dva dijela <quote>Cijena prodate robe</quote> i "
"<quote>Profit.</quote> Ova transakcija ima tri ulaza; jedna strana "
"dvostranog ulaza je podijeljena."

#. Tag: para
#: makemostof.docbook:66
#, no-c-format
msgid "This will be covered in more detail later on in this handbook."
msgstr "Ovo će biti objašnjeno detaljnije kasnije u priručniku."

#. Tag: title
#: makemostof.docbook:75
#, no-c-format
msgid "Defining the accounts (personal records)"
msgstr "Definiranje računa (lični arhiva)"

#. Tag: para
#: makemostof.docbook:77
#, fuzzy, no-c-format
#| msgid ""
#| "Most accounts, or pots, above represent a measure of our <quote>Worth.</"
#| "quote> The cash and goods represent our <quote>Assets;</quote> so does "
#| "what we are owed if our customers have not yet given us the money. The "
#| "money we owe, say if we had not paid our suppliers, are our "
#| "<quote>Liabilities.</quote> These accounts are transferable to Cash and "
#| "have a value."
msgid ""
"Most accounts, or pots, above represent a measure of our <quote>Worth</"
"quote>. The cash and goods represent our <quote>Assets</quote>; so does what "
"we are owed if our customers have not yet given us the money. The money we "
"owe, say if we had not paid our suppliers, are our <quote>Liabilities</"
"quote>. These accounts are transferable to Cash and have a value."
msgstr ""
"Većina računa, ili lonaca, iznad predstavljaju mjeru naše <quote>Vrijednost."
"</quote> Gotovina i roba predstavljaju našu <quote>Imovina;</quote> kao i "
"ono što nam duguju mušterije koje nam još uvijek nisu platile. Novac koji mi "
"dugujemo, ako nismo platili dobavljače, su naša <quote>Dugovanja.</quote> "
"Ovi računi se mogu pretvoriti u gotovinu i imaju vrijednost."

#. Tag: para
#: makemostof.docbook:85
#, fuzzy, no-c-format
#| msgid ""
#| "Any pots that cannot be valued are <quote>Income</quote> or "
#| "<quote>Expense.</quote> Our phone bill (or the phone company to which we "
#| "pay the bill) cannot be valued; we know how much we have paid, but not "
#| "how much anyone else has paid. We know how much our employer has paid us, "
#| "but we do not know how much they have paid anybody else, or how much "
#| "money they have left to pay us next month. Although we cannot determine "
#| "an actual value for these pots, it is useful to monitor how much we have "
#| "put into or taken out of each of them."
msgid ""
"Any pots that cannot be valued are <quote>Income</quote> or <quote>Expense</"
"quote>. Our phone bill (or the phone company to which we pay the bill) "
"cannot be valued; we know how much we have paid, but not how much anyone "
"else has paid. We know how much our employer has paid us, but we do not know "
"how much they have paid anybody else, or how much money they have left to "
"pay us next month. Although we cannot determine an actual value for these "
"pots, it is useful to monitor how much we have put into or taken out of each "
"of them."
msgstr ""
"Lonci kojima nije moguće odrediti vrijednosti su <quote>Prihodi</quote> ili "
"<quote>Rashodi.</quote> Naš telefonski račun (ili kompanija kojoj plaćamo) "
"ne može biti procijenjen; znamo koliko smo platili, ali ne znamo koliko je "
"neko drugi platio. Znamo koliko nam je platio naš poslodavac, ali ne znamo "
"koliko je platio ostalima, ili koliko su novca ostavili za naše plate idući "
"mjesec. Iako ne možemo odrediti stvarnu vrijednost ovih lonaca, korisno je "
"pratiti koliko smo stavili u njih ili koliko smo uzeli iz svakog od njih."

#. Tag: para
#: makemostof.docbook:96
#, fuzzy, no-c-format
#| msgid ""
#| "In some cases a supplier is a <quote>Liability,</quote> in others it is "
#| "an <quote>Expense.</quote> This is something we need to consider and "
#| "decide for each case. Similarly, you may set up a loan as a Liability, "
#| "particularly if you transfer the money into your bank account, but it "
#| "could be an Expense if it was to buy some furniture."
msgid ""
"In some cases a supplier is a <quote>Liability,</quote> in others it is an "
"<quote>Expense</quote>. This is something we need to consider and decide for "
"each case. Similarly, you may set up a loan as a Liability, particularly if "
"you transfer the money into your bank account, but it could be an Expense if "
"it was to buy some furniture."
msgstr ""
"U nekim slučajevima, dobavljač predstavlja <quote>Dugovanje,</quote> u nekim "
"predstavlja <quote>Rashod.</quote> Ovo je nešto što moramo uzeti u obzir "
"prilikom donošenja odluka. Slično tome, možete označiti kredit kao "
"Dugovanje, naročito ako prebacujete novac na svoj račun, ali mogao bi biti i "
"rashod ako je korišten za kupovinu nekog namještaja."

#. Tag: para
#: makemostof.docbook:104
#, fuzzy, no-c-format
#| msgid ""
#| "Consider how you want to track and analyze your income and expenses. This "
#| "will help you decide how to set them up in &kappname;."
msgid ""
"Consider how you want to track and analyze your income and expenses. This "
"will help you decide how to set them up in &kmymoney;."
msgstr ""
"Razmislite kako želite pratiti i analizirati vaše prihoda i rashode. To će "
"vam pomoći da odlučite kako da ih uspostavite u &kappname;."

#. Tag: para
#: makemostof.docbook:109
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Finally, consider if you want everything in one set of accounts, or two or "
"more. This may depend on the legal framework or just how you want to analyze "
"things. Each set of accounts would be handled separately."
msgstr ""
"I za kraj, razmislite ako želite da sve bude u jednom skupu računa, ili "
"možda dva ili više. Ovo može zavisiti od zakonskih okvira ili od načina vaše "
"analize. Svaki skup računa se tretira zasebno."

#. Tag: title
#: makemostof.docbook:117
#, no-c-format
msgid "Defining the accounts (business records)"
msgstr "Definiranje računa (poslovni arhiv)"

#. Tag: para
#: makemostof.docbook:119
#, fuzzy, no-c-format
#| msgid ""
#| "There are similarities to setting up accounts for personal use, but there "
#| "are additional considerations, including legal guidelines and "
#| "requirements. &kappname; does not explicitly address any of these issues, "
#| "as it has been designed as a <quote>personal</quote> finance manager. In "
#| "addition, these additional issues are not addressed in this handbook, but "
#| "you must be aware of them if you are going to attempt to use &kappname; "
#| "for a business."
msgid ""
"There are similarities to setting up accounts for personal use, but there "
"are additional considerations, including legal guidelines and requirements. "
"&kmymoney; does not explicitly address any of these issues, as it has been "
"designed as a <quote>personal</quote> finance manager. In addition, these "
"additional issues are not addressed in this handbook, but you must be aware "
"of them if you are going to attempt to use &kmymoney; for a business."
msgstr ""
"Postoje sličnosti u uspostavi računa za lično korištenje, ali postoje "
"dodatne stvari koje treba uzeti u razmatranje, uključujuči zakonske "
"regulative i zahtjeve. &kappname; se ne bavi eksplicitno ovim problemima, "
"jer je dizajniran kao <quote>lični</quote> upravitelj finansija. Dodatno, "
"ovaj priručnik se ne bavi tim problemima, ali trebate ih biti svjesni ako "
"ćete pokušati koristiti &kappname; za biznis."

#. Tag: title
#: makemostof.docbook:131
#, fuzzy, no-c-format
#| msgid "Mapping your finances to &kappname;"
msgid "Mapping your finances to &kmymoney;"
msgstr "Mapiranje vaših finansija u &kappname;"

#. Tag: para
#: makemostof.docbook:133
#, fuzzy, no-c-format
#| msgid ""
#| "So, collect up your papers and see the following sections for each item "
#| "in &kappname;."
msgid ""
"So, collect up your papers and see the following sections for each item in "
"&kmymoney;."
msgstr ""
"Dakle, prikupite papire i pogledajte sljedeće sekcije za svaku od stavki u "
"&kappname;-u."

#. Tag: title
#: makemostof.docbook:139
#, no-c-format
msgid "Accounts"
msgstr "Računi"

#. Tag: para
#: makemostof.docbook:141
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"These hold a value. Transactions are created against one or more accounts."
msgstr ""
"Oni čuvaju vrijednosti. Transakcije su kreirane pomoću jednog ili više "
"računa."

#. Tag: title
#: makemostof.docbook:146
#, no-c-format
msgid "Accounts - Asset"
msgstr "Računi - Imovina"

#. Tag: para
#: makemostof.docbook:148
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"These are the accounts which hold your money and possessions that you wish "
"to monitor. The following types are available:"
msgstr ""
"Ovo su računi na kojima se nalazi vaš novac i imovina koju želite prikazati. "
"Dosutpne su sljedeće vrste:"

#. Tag: term
#: makemostof.docbook:155
#, no-c-format
msgid "Checking"
msgstr "Čekovni"

#. Tag: para
#: makemostof.docbook:157
#, no-c-format
msgid "Standard bank checking account."
msgstr "Standardni bankovni čekovni račun."

#. Tag: term
#: makemostof.docbook:164
#, no-c-format
msgid "Savings"
msgstr "Ušteđevina"

#. Tag: para
#: makemostof.docbook:166
#, no-c-format
msgid "Standard bank savings account."
msgstr "Standardni bankovni račun za ušteđevinu."

#. Tag: term
#: makemostof.docbook:173
#, no-c-format
msgid "Cash"
msgstr "Gotovina"

#. Tag: para
#: makemostof.docbook:175
#, no-c-format
msgid "Money in your hand or wallet."
msgstr "Novac u vašoj ruci ili novčaniku."

#. Tag: term
#: makemostof.docbook:182 makemostof.docbook:229
#, no-c-format
msgid "Loan"
msgstr "Pozajmice"

#. Tag: para
#: makemostof.docbook:184
#, no-c-format
msgid "Loans you make to someone else."
msgstr "Pozajmice od vas nekom drugom."

#. Tag: term
#: makemostof.docbook:191
#, no-c-format
msgid "Investment"
msgstr "Ulaganje"

#. Tag: para
#: makemostof.docbook:193
#, no-c-format
msgid "Money you invest."
msgstr "Novac koji ulažete."

#. Tag: term
#: makemostof.docbook:200
#, no-c-format
msgid "Asset"
msgstr "Imovina"

#. Tag: para
#: makemostof.docbook:202
#, fuzzy, no-c-format
#| msgid "Property, collections, etc."
msgid "Property, collections, &etc;"
msgstr "Imovina, kolekcije, itd."

#. Tag: title
#: makemostof.docbook:211
#, no-c-format
msgid "Accounts - Liability"
msgstr "Računi - Dugovanja"

#. Tag: para
#: makemostof.docbook:213
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"These are the accounts which represent your debts and money owed that you "
"wish to monitor. The following types are available:"
msgstr ""
"Ovo su računi koji predstavljaju vaše dugove i dugovanja koja želite "
"prikazati. Dostupne su sljedeće vrste:"

#. Tag: term
#: makemostof.docbook:220
#, no-c-format
msgid "Credit card"
msgstr "Kreditna kartica"

#. Tag: para
#: makemostof.docbook:222
#, no-c-format
msgid "Standard credit card account."
msgstr "Standardni račun za kreditnu karticu."

#. Tag: para
#: makemostof.docbook:231
#, fuzzy, no-c-format
#| msgid "Loans made to you, mortgages, etc."
msgid "Loans made to you, mortgages, &etc;"
msgstr "Krediti koje ste podigli, hipoteke, itd."

#. Tag: term
#: makemostof.docbook:238
#, no-c-format
msgid "Liability"
msgstr "Dugovanje"

#. Tag: para
#: makemostof.docbook:240
#, no-c-format
msgid "Anything else you owe that is not a loan."
msgstr "Sve ostalo što dugujute, a nije kredit."

#. Tag: title
#: makemostof.docbook:250
#, no-c-format
msgid "Institutions"
msgstr "Institucije"

#. Tag: para
#: makemostof.docbook:252
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"These are completely optional and can be used to group accounts, and show a "
"total value for all accounts in each group."
msgstr ""
"One su totalno opcionalne i mogu biti korištene za grupisanje računa, i "
"prikazuju totalnu vrijednosti svih računa u svakoj grupi."

#. Tag: title
#: makemostof.docbook:259
#, no-c-format
msgid "Categories"
msgstr "Kategorije"

#. Tag: para
#: makemostof.docbook:261
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"These represent non-managed income and expense accounts that do not have a "
"value. The total value of transactions is shown against each category. A "
"category or transfer account is required for each transaction."
msgstr ""
"One predstavljaju neupravljane račune prihoda i rashoda koji nemaju "
"vrijednost. Totalna vrijednost transakcija je prikazana za svaku kategoriju. "
"Kategorija transfer računa je neophodna za svaku transakciju."

#. Tag: title
#: makemostof.docbook:269
#, no-c-format
msgid "Sub-Categories"
msgstr "Pod-kategorije"

#. Tag: para
#: makemostof.docbook:271
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Categories can be split into sub-categories, but this relationship is only "
"for display purposes, as the sub-category totals are not included in the "
"higher level category total."
msgstr ""
"Kategorije mogu biti podijeljene u pod-kategorije, ali ova veza je samo u "
"svrhu prikaza, jer iznosi pod-kategorija nisu uključeni u iznos više "
"kategorije."

#. Tag: title
#: makemostof.docbook:279
#, no-c-format
msgid "Tags"
msgstr "Oznake"

#. Tag: para
#: makemostof.docbook:281
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Tags are very similar to Categories, as they are also non-managed accounts "
"that do not have a value. However, unlike Categories, the use of Tags is "
"completely optional."
msgstr ""
"Oznake su veoma slične kategorijama, jer su i one neupravljani računi koji "
"nemaju vrijednost. Međutim, za razliku od kategorija, upotreba oznaka je "
"potpuno opcionalna."

#. Tag: title
#: makemostof.docbook:289
#, no-c-format
msgid "Payees"
msgstr "Primatelji uplata"

#. Tag: para
#: makemostof.docbook:291
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"These are optional for transactions. They are required for Scheduled "
"transactions. A transaction history, with category, is shown against each "
"payee."
msgstr ""
"Oni su opcionalni za transakcije. Neophodni su za zakazane transakcije. "
"Historija transakcija, sa kategorijama, je prikazana za svakog primatelja "
"uplate."

#. Tag: title
#: makemostof.docbook:299
#, no-c-format
msgid "Scheduled transactions"
msgstr "Planirane transakcije"

#. Tag: para
#: makemostof.docbook:301
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Where transactions occur on a regular basis, these can be set up against a "
"Schedule. Transactions are created from a schedule; any that are overdue can "
"be seen on the home page."
msgstr ""
"U slučajevima kada se transakcije redovno odvijaju, može biti napravljen "
"raspored. Transakcije su kreirane iz rasporeda; ako je istekao rok za neku "
"od njih, ona je prikazana na početnoj stranici."

#. Tag: title
#: makemostof.docbook:310
#, no-c-format
msgid "Useful Tips"
msgstr "Korisni savjeti"

#. Tag: para
#: makemostof.docbook:312
#, fuzzy, no-c-format
#| msgid ""
#| "Unless you keep your money under your mattress or under the floorboards, "
#| "you probably make use of one or more institutions where you have "
#| "accounts, which may be in credit or debit. In order to familiarize "
#| "yourself with the way &kappname; works, choose an account you want to "
#| "track with &kappname; and select <menuchoice><guimenu>File</guimenu> "
#| "<guimenuitem>New</guimenuitem></menuchoice> in order to set up an account "
#| "file."
msgid ""
"Unless you keep your money under your mattress or under the floorboards, you "
"probably make use of one or more institutions where you have accounts, which "
"may be in credit or debit. In order to familiarize yourself with the way "
"&kmymoney; works, choose an account you want to track with &kmymoney; and "
"select the <menuchoice><guimenu>File</guimenu><guimenuitem>New</guimenuitem> "
"</menuchoice> menu item in order to set up an account file."
msgstr ""
"Osim ako držite novac ispod madraca ili ispod parketa, vjerovatno koristite "
"jednu ili više institucija gdje imate otvorene račune, koji mogu biti "
"kreditni ili debitni. Da biste se upoznali sa načinom na koji &kappname; "
"radi, odaberite račun koji želite pratiti sa &kappname;-om i odaberite "
"<menuchoice><guimenu>Datoteka</guimenu> <guimenuitem>Nova</guimenuitem></"
"menuchoice> da biste kreirali datoteku za račun."

#. Tag: para
#: makemostof.docbook:321
#, fuzzy, no-c-format
#| msgid ""
#| "If you have used another personal finance manager, you may be able to "
#| "import the data from it into &kappname;."
msgid ""
"If you have used another personal finance manager, you may be able to import "
"the data from it into &kmymoney;."
msgstr ""
"Ako ste koristili neki drugi upravitelj ličnih finansija, možda ćete moći "
"uvesti podatke iz njega u &kappname;."

#. Tag: para
#: makemostof.docbook:326
#, fuzzy, no-c-format
#| msgid ""
#| "If you have some regular receipts into or outgoings from this account, go "
#| "to Payee and enter the names of both the payers and the payees involved; "
#| "then go to Schedule and fill in a New Schedule for each recurring "
#| "transaction. If you haven't entered the payee or payer, &kappname; will "
#| "offer you the opportunity to do this in the middle of entering the "
#| "schedule."
msgid ""
"If you have some regular receipts into or outgoings from this account, go to "
"Payee and enter the names of both the payers and the payees involved; then "
"go to Schedule and fill in a New Schedule for each recurring transaction. If "
"you haven't entered the payee or payer, &kmymoney; will offer you the "
"opportunity to do this in the middle of entering the schedule."
msgstr ""
"Ako imate neke račune na dolasku ili odlasku u ovom računu, idite na "
"primatelja uplate i unesite imena primatelja i pošiljatelja uplate; onda "
"idite na raspored i unesite novi raspored za svaku od transakcija koja se "
"ponavlja. Ako niste unijeli primatelja ili pošiljatelja uplate, &kappname; "
"će vam ponuditi šansu da to uradite tokom unošenja rasporeda."

#. Tag: para
#: makemostof.docbook:334
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"To add other new transactions go to Ledgers; you can add new payees and "
"categories in the middle of a transaction or by going to Payees or "
"Categories before entering the transaction."
msgstr ""
"Da biste dodali neke druge transakcije u finansijsku knjigu; možete dodati "
"nove primatelje uplata i kategorije tokom odvijanja transakcije ili to "
"možete uraditi tako što odete na primatelje uplata ili kategorije prije "
"unošenja transakcije."

#. Tag: para
#: makemostof.docbook:340
#, fuzzy, no-c-format
#| msgid ""
#| "You will probably find that the default Categories do not exactly match "
#| "your needs; you can easily delete ones you know you are never going to "
#| "need and add others that you need. But when you are entering a "
#| "transaction, you only have to type a few letters of a category and "
#| "&kappname; will offer you a drop down list of the matching categories "
#| "from which to choose."
msgid ""
"You will probably find that the default Categories do not exactly match your "
"needs; you can easily delete ones you know you are never going to need and "
"add others that you need. But when you are entering a transaction, you only "
"have to type a few letters of a category and &kmymoney; will offer you a "
"drop down list of the matching categories from which to choose."
msgstr ""
"Unaprijed definisane kategorije vam vjerovatno neće odgovarati; lako možete "
"obrisati one za koje znate da ih nećete koristiti i dodati druge koje ćete "
"koristiti. Kada unosite transakciju, trebate unijeti samo par slova neke "
"kategorije i &kappname; će vam ponuditi opadajuću listu odgovarajućih "
"kategorija iz koje možete odabrati onu koja vam treba."

#. Tag: para
#: makemostof.docbook:348
#, fuzzy, no-c-format
#| msgid ""
#| "You can add different accounts managed by different institutions; the "
#| "preferred one will show when you open &kappname; but you can quickly "
#| "switch to any of the others."
msgid ""
"You can add different accounts managed by different institutions; the "
"preferred one will show when you open &kmymoney; but you can quickly switch "
"to any of the others."
msgstr ""
"Možete dodati različite račune kojima upravljaju druge institucije; primarni "
"će biti prikazan kada otvorite &kappname;, ali možete se brzo prebacivati na "
"ostale."

#. Tag: para
#: makemostof.docbook:354
#, fuzzy, no-c-format
#| msgid ""
#| "When you make a payment, &kappname; will work out what the next check "
#| "number should be; delete this if you are not making a check payment or "
#| "edit it if the first check you enter is not check number 1. "
#| "Alternatively, it is possible to switch off auto-increment of check "
#| "numbers."
msgid ""
"When you make a payment, &kmymoney; will work out what the next check number "
"should be; delete this if you are not making a check payment or edit it if "
"the first check you enter is not check number 1. Alternatively, it is "
"possible to switch off auto-increment of check numbers."
msgstr ""
"Kada vršite uplatu, &kappname; će provjeriti koji je broj čeka potreban; "
"obrisati ga ako ne plaćate čekom ili ga urediti ako prvi ček koji unosite "
"nije ček broj 1. Također, moguće je isključiti automatsko uvećavanje broja "
"čeka."

#. Tag: para
#: makemostof.docbook:361
#, fuzzy, no-c-format
#| msgid ""
#| "Every so often you may get statements of your account from the "
#| "institutions you use; you can reconcile your &kappname; accounts against "
#| "these statements so that you have an accurate statement of the current "
#| "state of your finances."
msgid ""
"Every so often you may get statements of your account from the institutions "
"you use; you can reconcile your &kmymoney; accounts against these statements "
"so that you have an accurate statement of the current state of your finances."
msgstr ""
"Ponekad možete dobiti izvještaje o vašem računu od institucije koju "
"koristite; možete uskladiti vaše &kappname; račune u skladu sa ovim "
"izvještajima tako da imate tačan izvještaj stanja vaših finansija."

#. Tag: para
#: makemostof.docbook:367
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"If you go to Reports, you will find several default reports; to customize "
"these, open one similar to the sort you prefer and then select 'New' (not "
"'Copy'); you can then customize this to your needs and mark it as a "
"preferred report if you wish."
msgstr ""
"Ako odete na izvještaje, pronaći ćete nekoliko unaprijed definisanih "
"izvještaja; da biste ih uredili, odaberite onaj koji je sličan onom koji vam "
"treba i onda odaberite 'Novi' (ne 'Kopiraj'); onda ga možete urediti tako da "
"odgovara vašim potrebama i označiti kao preferirani izvještaj, ako želite."

#. Tag: para
#: makemostof.docbook:374
#, fuzzy, no-c-format
#| msgid ""
#| "Though &kappname; is not intended for use in a business context, if you "
#| "are running a business on your own and so do not need payroll functions, "
#| "you will probably find that &kappname; is sufficiently customizable to "
#| "meet your needs particularly as it comes with budgeting and forecasting "
#| "features and you can export your customized reports via CSV into other "
#| "applications."
msgid ""
"Though &kmymoney; is not intended for use in a business context, if you are "
"running a business on your own and so do not need payroll functions, you "
"will probably find that &kmymoney; is sufficiently customizable to meet your "
"needs particularly as it comes with budgeting and forecasting features and "
"you can export your customized reports via CSV into other applications."
msgstr ""
"Iako &kappname; nije namijenjen za upotrebu u biznis konteksu, ako sami "
"vodite posao i ne trebate funkcije za plaćanje, vjerovatno ćete uvidjeti da "
"je &kappname; moguće urediti tako da odgovara vašim potrebama, naročito jer "
"dolazi sa mogućnostima proračuna i prognoze budžeta. Možete prenijeti vaše "
"uređene CSV izvještaje u druge aplikacije."

#~ msgid "<releaseinfo>4.5</releaseinfo>"
#~ msgstr "<releaseinfo>4.5</releaseinfo>"
